WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.752 --> 00:00:04.546
Everybody knows 
the AMBER Alert.

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:07.424
This is an activation of 
the AMBER Alert System.

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:11.678
I want the world to 
know who Amber was.

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:15.765
Saturday they decided they 
want to ride their bicycles.

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:20.228
That was my last 
time seeing her.

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:27.944
I immediately thought, "Oh 
my gosh. She was targeted."

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:32.198
Donna was gonna make 
sure this would not happen

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.616
to any other child.

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:36.411
I wouldn't be here 
without her.

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:38.246
If we just gotten 
the word out,

00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:39.247
she could have been found.

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:42.083
Amber's killer is out 
there somewhere.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:44.878
Who murdered my little girl?

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:46.546
Everybody is a suspect.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:47.672
Thousands of leads.

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:49.424
The person who kidnapped

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:50.508
and murdered 
Amber Hagerman

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:52.635
is still alive.

